{"ID":"20240205153633-joxrd5q","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153633-joxrd5q","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153633-joxrd5q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164517-byx8rfk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164517-byx8rfk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:284,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164517-byx8rfk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"夜交藤","type":"doc","updated":"20240830163556"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205164517-byx8rfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164517-byx8rfk","updated":"20240205164517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"夜交腾"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/夜交腾-20240205164517-ojv85th.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711125837-x8a1nxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711125837-x8a1nxu","updated":"20240711125837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"何首乌"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/何首乌-20240709141428-huevk4y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711125837-k3g0ezr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711125837-k3g0ezr","updated":"20240711125837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 315px;","style":"width: 305px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240711125509-44k4vsp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 305px;\" parent-style=\"width: 315px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 367px;","style":"width: 357px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240711090156-uxilvf2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 357px;\" parent-style=\"width: 367px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 474px;","style":"width: 464px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240711090302-3s7ubt3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 464px;\" parent-style=\"width: 474px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711125837-2datp0e","Type":"NodeVideo","Data":"\u003cvideo controls=\"controls\" src=\"assets/何首乌-20240711124435-zfroyee.mp4\" data-src=\"assets/何首乌-20240711124435-zfroyee.mp4\" style=\"width: 454px; height: 838px;\"\u003e\u003c/video\u003e","Properties":{"id":"20240711125837-2datp0e","updated":"20240711125837"}},{"ID":"20240711125837-x9926gi","Type":"NodeVideo","Data":"\u003cvideo controls=\"controls\" src=\"assets/何首乌-20240711114601-bpt6rod.mp4\" data-src=\"assets/何首乌-20240711114601-bpt6rod.mp4\" style=\"width: 448px; height: 872px;\"\u003e\u003c/video\u003e","Properties":{"id":"20240711125837-x9926gi","updated":"20240711125837"}},{"ID":"20240710195249-klaee55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710195249-klaee55","updated":"20240711125930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一注：夜交藤就是何首乌的藤茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240711125911-30ezuby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711125911-30ezuby","updated":"20240711125925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：何首乌假货过多，实难找到靠谱图片资料，为此仅附上个人感觉较为靠谱的视频。（取自抖音‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"彦无歇……"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，抖音号："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2013599266"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240711125911-uhj4z8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711125911-uhj4z8h","updated":"20240711130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三注：根据所查到的结果，个人感觉除非是自己采药（还得看机缘），网络上买是买不到真正的何首乌了。"}]},{"ID":"20240711125911-fr7m5dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711125911-fr7m5dq","updated":"20240711125923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四注：根据《本草纲目》记载，何首乌达三百年以上便可以成为山精，久服可以让人返老还童、仙风道骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240711125911-vp8mw7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711125911-vp8mw7f","updated":"20240711130242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"五注：因为真正的何首乌太难甄别，五六个小时搜索查证也无明显进展，插入视频实是无奈之举；两个视频相对于图片来说占用是在太大了；"}]},{"ID":"20240710195250-gy9h2ae","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240710195250-gy9h2ae"}},{"ID":"20240830163549-2dxktfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-2dxktfh","updated":"20240830163556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：夜交藤"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-pdge2ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-pdge2ph","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夜交藤《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-ho4u0td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-ho4u0td","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-ukj9bdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-ukj9bdc","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YèJiāoTénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-bzsdzuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-bzsdzuq","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】棋藤（《南京民间药草》），首乌藤（《江苏植药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-5dvoes4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-5dvoes4","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为蓼科植物何首乌的藤茎或带叶藤茎。带叶的藤茎，于夏、秋采取。但商品大都用藤茎，于秋季叶落后割取，除去细枝、残叶，切成长约70厘米的段落，捆成把，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-1uxndrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-1uxndrt","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】植物形态详\"何首乌\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-vj5gf09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-vj5gf09","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】主产河南、湖北、湖南、江苏、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-2ahjfb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-2ahjfb3","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-w4nzgpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-w4nzgpn","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥的藤茎呈细长圆柱状，通常扭曲，有时分枝，直径3～7毫米。表面紫褐色，粗糙，有扭曲的纵皱纹和节，并散生红色小斑点，栓皮菲薄，呈鳞片状剥落。质硬而鹿，易折断，断面皮部棕红色，木部淡黄色，木质部呈放射状，中央为白色疏松的髓部。气无，味微苦涩。以粗壮均匀、外表紫褐色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-84koqwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-84koqwh","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四川商品为干燥的带叶嫩茎。茎细，黄绿色或黄褐色，叶多皱缩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-n5jj9te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-n5jj9te","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】茎含蒽醌类，主要为大黄素、大黄酚或大黄素甲醚，均以结合型存在。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-l6shxcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-l6shxcg","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】清水洗净，稍浸泡，捞出，润透后，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-sfcxa1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-sfcxa1f","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-xnnvk6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-xnnvk6f","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘微苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-cu6ijho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-cu6ijho","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草再新》：\"味苦，性温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-5hwfd0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-5hwfd0i","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《饮片新参》：\"苦涩微甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-3he5kjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-3he5kjw","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《陕西中草药》：\"性平，味甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-xs5us0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-xs5us0p","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-uftigbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-uftigbs","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-es97o30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-es97o30","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草再新》：\"入心、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-mlsgtb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-mlsgtb1","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《四川中药志》：\"入肝、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-xz2c9r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-xz2c9r4","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-or8op9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-or8op9s","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"养心，安神，通络，祛风。治失眠，劳伤，多汗，血虚身痛，痈疽，瘰疬，风疮疥癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-veck5tx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-veck5tx","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"风疮疥癣作痒，煎汤洗浴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-y8t5x0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-y8t5x0d","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"补中气，行经络，通血脉，治劳伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-jvshefc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-jvshefc","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正义》：\"治夜少安寐。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-alk5cxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-alk5cxv","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《饮片新参》：\"养肝肾，止虚汗，安神催眠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-h76n8y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-h76n8y2","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《安徽药材》：\"消痈肿、瘰疬和痔疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-rlop02j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-rlop02j","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《陕西中草药》：\"祛风湿，通经络。治失眠，多汗，贫血，周身酸痛，疥癣等皮肤病。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-h7r4k38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-h7r4k38","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，2～4钱。外用：煎水洗或捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-ywmycm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-ywmycm8","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-tk52ofb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-tk52ofb","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治彻夜不寐，间日轻重，如发疟：夜交藤（切）四钱，真珠母八钱，龙齿二钱，柴胡（醋炒）一钱，薄荷一钱，生地六钱，归身二钱，白芍（酒炒）一钱五分，丹参二钱，柏子仁二钱，夜合花二钱，沉香五分，红枣十枚。水煎服。（《医醇媵义》甲乙归脏汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-pat1izn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-pat1izn","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治腋疽：首乌藤、鸡屎藤叶各适量。捣烂，敷患处。（《广西民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-4jcqncg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-4jcqncg","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治痔疮肿痛：首乌藤、假蒌叶、杉木叶各适量。煎水洗患处。（《广西民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-ar8a8k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-ar8a8k9","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《本草正义》：\"夜交藤，濒湖止称茎叶治风疮疥癣，作浴汤甚效，今以治夜少安寐，盖取其能引阳入阴耳。然不寐之源，亦非一端，苟不知从病源上着想，而惟以此为普通用品，则亦无效。但止堪供佐使之助，因是调和阴阳者，故亦有利无害。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-8spdkmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-8spdkmm","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-tlrhn8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-tlrhn8i","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夜交藤《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-9cbrh21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-9cbrh21","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-a3vipcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-a3vipcx","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YèJiāoTénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-2wdjjnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-2wdjjnb","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】棋藤、首乌藤"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-twqxw3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-twqxw3w","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-649bua8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-649bua8","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为蓼科植物何首乌的藤茎或带叶的藤茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-dz3y5m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-dz3y5m7","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：PolygonummultiflorumThunb."}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-ppx5hgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-ppx5hgu","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋采割带叶藤茎，或秋、冬采割藤茎，除支残叶，捆成把，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-qzqvoq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-qzqvoq9","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生缠绕藤本。根细长，末端成肥大的块根，外表红褐色至暗褐色。茎基部略呈木质，中空。叶互生；具长柄；托叶鞘膜质，褐色；叶片狭卵形或心形，长4-8cm，宽2.5-5cm，先端渐尖，基部心形或箭形，全缘或微带波状，上面深绿色，下面浅绿色，两面均光滑无毛。圆锥花序。小花梗具节，基都具膜质苞片；花小，花被绿白色，5裂，大小不等，外面3片的背部有翅；雄蕊8，不等长，短于花被；雌蕊1，柱头3裂，头状。瘦果椭圆形，有3棱，黑色，光亮，外包宿存花被，花被具明显的3翅。花期8-10月，果期9-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-wc0bdfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-wc0bdfb","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-inpknmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-inpknmk","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于草坡、路边、山坡石隙及灌木丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-a0pyh96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-a0pyh96","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于华东、中南及河北、山西、陕西、甘肃、台湾、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-tzgp3xt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-tzgp3xt","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-qv4zub8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-qv4zub8","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别藤茎长圆柱形，稍扭曲，长短不一，直径3-7mm。表面棕红色或棕褐色，粗糙，有明显扭曲的纵皱纹及细小圆形皮孔。节部略膨大，有分枝痕。外皮菲薄，剥离。质脆，易折断，断面皮部棕红色，木部淡黄色，导管孔明显，中央为白色疏松的髓部。气无，味微苦、涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-xea7qay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-xea7qay","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以枝条粗壮、均匀、外皮棕红色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-jnyqwh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-jnyqwh1","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别茎横切面：木栓层为数列含棕色色素的细胞。皮层较薄。中柱鞘纤维束断续排列成环，伴有少数石细胞群，纤维壁甚厚，木化。韧皮部较宽，束中形成层明显；木质部导管单个散在或数个相聚。髓部小。薄壁细胞含草酸钙簇晶。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-v6w91z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-v6w91z7","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】藤茎中含大黄素（emodim）,大黄素甲醚（Physcion）A即是大黄素-百-葡萄糖甙（emodin-8-β-D-glucopyranoside），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol）[1]。还含夜交藤乙酰本甙（polygoacetophenoside）即是2，3，4，6-四羟基乙酸苯-3-O－葡萄糖甙（2，3，4，6－tetrahydroxyacetoPheone－3－O-β-D-glucopyranoside)［2］."}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-dm4lt5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-dm4lt5y","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】有镇静和泻下作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-mo4lv39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-mo4lv39","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】清水洗净，稍浸泡，捞出，润透后，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-cruoypj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-cruoypj","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘;微苦;性平"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-meby5ia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-meby5ia","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】心;肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-f7y599l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-f7y599l","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】养心安神;祛风;通络。主失眠;多梦;血虚身痛；肌肤麻木；风湿痹痛；风疹瘙痒"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-s2pthrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-s2pthrs","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，10～20g。外用：适量，煎水洗；或捣烂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-jqen3ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-jqen3ya","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】燥狂属实火者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-voj1rmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-voj1rmn","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-sk2mu47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-sk2mu47","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草正义》：夜交藤，濒湖止称茎叶治风疮疥癣，作浴汤甚效，今以治夜少安寐，盖取其能引阳入阴耳，然不寐之源，亦非一端，苟不知从病源上着想，而惟以此为普通用品，则亦无效。但止堪供佐使之助，因是调和阴阳者，故亦有利无害。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-pdcjzn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-pdcjzn3","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：风疮疥癣作痒，煎汤洗浴。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-658andm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-658andm","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草再新》：补中气，行经络，通血脉，治劳伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-2unljdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-2unljdo","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草正义》：治夜少安寐。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-2pj52c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-2pj52c7","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《饮片新参》：养肝肾，止虚汗，安神催眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-wq4r5ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-wq4r5ke","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《安徽药材》：消痈肿、瘰疬和痔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-vc52e5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-vc52e5k","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《陕西中草药》：祛风湿，通经络。治头眠，多汗，贫血，周身酸痛，疥癣等皮肤病。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163549-wrcc5dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163549-wrcc5dv","updated":"20240830163622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163551-n2u75ok","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830163551-n2u75ok","updated":"20240830163622"}},{"ID":"20240830163552-jw5flqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163552-jw5flqs","updated":"20240830163622"}}]}